<title>UK: Citibank sets call, put warrants on U.S stocks.</title>
<headline>Citibank sets call, put warrants on U.S stocks.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Citibank Na has issued American-style call and put warrants of five million per series on six U.S stocks.</p>
<p>The warrants are on shares of Amgen Inc, Digital Equipment Corp, Gillette Co, J.P. Morgan and Co Inc, Kmart K and PepsiCo Inc. The maturity date is April 7, 1998 and payment date is February 3, 1997. The warrants are available in minimum lots of 1,000 and are listed on the Paris stock exchange.</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
